msgid ""
"\n"
"ℹ️ <b>关于投稿机器人</b>\n"
"\n"
"这是一个投稿机器人，支持图文 / 文件投稿，提交前可预览确认。\n"
"\n"
"<b>常用命令</b>\n"
"/submit 发起投稿\n"
"/mystats 查看我的投稿统计\n"
"/cancel 取消当前投稿\n"
"/help 查看完整帮助\n"
"\n"
"<b>🔗 开源：</b> https://github.com/redtidev1918/TelePost\n"
"\n"
"<i>有问题可以私聊管理员。</i>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ℹ️ <b>About TelePost</b>\n"
"\n"
"Submit text, media and files, and preview before sending.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Commands</b>\n"
"/submit New submission\n"
"/mystats My submission stats\n"
"/cancel Cancel current submission\n"
"/help Help\n"
"\n"
"<b>🔗 Source:</b> https://github.com/redtidev1918/TelePost\n"
"\n"
"<i>Contact an admin if you need help.</i>\n"

