msgid ""
"\n"
"📝 <b>投稿指南</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>支持的内容</b>\n"
"• 🖼️ 图片（单张或多张）\n"
"• 🎥 视频 / 📹 动图 (GIF) / 🔉 音频\n"
"• 📁 压缩包 / PDF 等文档附件\n"
"\n"
"<b>投稿流程</b>\n"
"1️⃣ 发送 /submit 开始\n"
"2️⃣ 上传内容（选填标签、标题、简介、链接）\n"
"3️⃣ 发送 /done_media 打开预览\n"
"4️⃣ 修改确认后发布 / 提交审核\n"
"\n"
"<b>小提示</b>\n"
"• 内容里加 #标签 更容易被发现\n"
"• 随时发送 /cancel 取消投稿\n"
"\n"
"<i>准备好了吗？发送 /submit 开始！</i>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"📝 <b>Submission guide</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Supported content</b>\n"
"• 🖼️ Images (one or more)\n"
"• 🎥 Videos / 📹 GIFs / 🔉 Audio\n"
"• 📁 Archives, PDFs and other files\n"
"\n"
"<b>Steps</b>\n"
"1️⃣ Send /submit\n"
"2️⃣ Upload content (add tags, a title, a note and a link in the preview)\n"
"3️⃣ Send /done_media to preview\n"
"4️⃣ Check and publish / submit for review\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tips</b>\n"
"• Add #tags to help people find your post\n"
"• Send /cancel at any step to cancel\n"
"\n"
"<i>Send /submit to get started.</i>\n"

