"• 一次最多删除 50 个帖子"
msgstr ""
"📝 <b>Bulk deletion help</b>\n"
"\n"
"<b>Usage:</b>\n"
"/delete_posts [message_id1] [message_id2] ...\n"
"/delete_posts [start_id-end_id]\n"
"\n"
"<b>Examples:</b>\n"
"• /delete_posts 123 456 789\n"
"  Delete messages 123, 456 and 789\n"
"\n"
"• /delete_posts 100-110\n"
"  Delete messages 100 through 110\n"
"\n"
"• /delete_posts 100-110 150 200-205\n"
"  Mix ranges and individual IDs\n"
"\n"
"<b>⚠️ Effects:</b>\n"
"• Deletes channel messages, updates database records and removes index entries\n"
"• At most 50 posts per request"

